Package: loopwire
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Loopwire contributors <dskvr@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: nodejs, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0
Recommends: pipewire, wireplumber, pipewire-pulse, pulseaudio-utils, alsa-utils, jackd2
Homepage: https://github.com/sandwichfarm/loopwire
Description: Linux virtual audio routing workspace
 Loopwire creates and manages virtual devices, app capture routes,
 monitor paths, presets, and backend diagnostics on Linux desktops.
